{
  "name": "Vendedores: correos tras el pago (nodos para pegar)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "v1",
              "name": "nombre",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.nombre }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "v2",
              "name": "apellido",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.apellido }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "v3",
              "name": "email",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.email }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "v4",
              "name": "telefono",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.telefono }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "v5",
              "name": "concesionario",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.nombre_concesionario }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "v6",
              "name": "marcas",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ Array.isArray($json.marcas) ? $json.marcas.join(', ') : $json.marcas }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "vd-set",
      "name": "Datos correo vendedor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "Lee la fila de leads_vendors que devuelve 'Update a row' (pago confirmado)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.resend.com/emails",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "from",
              "value": "Electrificarte <no-reply@electrificarte.com>"
            },
            {
              "name": "to",
              "value": "={{ $('Datos correo vendedor').item.json.email }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "Bienvenido a la red de vendedores oficiales"
            },
            {
              "name": "html",
              "value": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <title>Electrificarte</title>\n</head>\n<!--\n  VENDEDORES: bienvenida al vendedor tras pagar la suscripción.\n  Lee del nodo Set \"Datos correo vendedor\": nombre, concesionario, marcas.\n  Terminología: \"punto de venta\" / \"vendedores oficiales\", nunca \"concesionario\" en el copy.\n\n  GENERADO por scripts/gen-emails.mjs (sistema de diseño v1). No editar a mano: cambiá el\n  generador y corré  node scripts/gen-emails.mjs && node scripts/gen-waitlist-reviews-workflows.mjs\n  Todo dato que escribe el usuario va escapado para HTML.\n-->\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f7f6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Recibimos tu registro y tu pago. Bienvenido a la red de vendedores oficiales.</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f2f7f6;\">\n    <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 20px;\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n            <td><picture><source srcset=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-niebla.png\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"><img src=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-tinta.png\" alt=\"Electrificarte\" width=\"218\" height=\"16\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:218px;height:16px;\"></picture></td>\n          </tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n        <tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dfe4e4;border-radius:12px;padding:36px 32px 32px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0f1716;\">Bienvenido a la red de vendedores</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Hola <strong style=\"font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;\">{{ String(($('Datos correo vendedor').item.json.nombre) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</strong>, recibimos tu registro y tu pago. Tu cuenta está en revisión: en breve te contactamos para activarla y que empieces a recibir clientes interesados en los modelos que vendes.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;background:#caefea;border-radius:12px;\">\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:20px;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#0f1716;\">Tu suscripción</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:4px 0 0;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0f1716;\">Vendedor oficial, $12.990 al mes</p>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;border-top:1px solid #dfe4e4;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Nombre</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Datos correo vendedor').item.json.nombre) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Punto de venta</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Datos correo vendedor').item.json.concesionario) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'Sin indicar' }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Marcas</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Datos correo vendedor').item.json.marcas) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'Sin indicar' }}</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#0f1716;\">Qué sigue</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;border-top:1px solid #dfe4e4;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:8%;\">1</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">Revisamos tu información y tus marcas.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:8%;\">2</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">Te contactamos para activar tu acceso al panel.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:8%;\">3</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">Empiezas a recibir personas interesadas en tus modelos.</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;font-size:14px;\">¿Algún dato está mal? Escríbenos a <a href=\"mailto:vendedores@electrificarte.com\" style=\"color:#1d605b;\">vendedores@electrificarte.com</a>.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0;\"><tr>\n  <td style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#1d605b;\">\n    <a href=\"https://vendedores.electrificarte.com\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;\">Ir a la página de vendedores</a>\n  </td>\n</tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 0 0;\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#0f1716;border-radius:12px;\">\n            <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 32px;\">\n              <img src=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-niebla.png\" alt=\"Electrificarte\" width=\"190\" height=\"14\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:190px;height:14px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:12px 0 20px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#b4bdbc;\">El marketplace de autos electrificados de Chile. Conéctate a una nueva movilidad.</p>\n              <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n                <td style=\"padding:0 16px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"https://vendedores.electrificarte.com\" style=\"font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#caefea;text-decoration:none;\">Página de vendedores</a></td><td style=\"padding:0 16px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/marcas\" style=\"font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#caefea;text-decoration:none;\">Catálogo</a></td><td style=\"padding:0 16px 8px 0;\"><a href=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/blog\" style=\"font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#caefea;text-decoration:none;\">Blog</a></td>\n              </tr></table>\n              <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #27302f;\"><tr>\n                <td style=\"padding-top:16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#b4bdbc;\">\n                  <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/autos.electricos.con.francisco\" style=\"color:#b4bdbc;text-decoration:underline;\">Instagram</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n                  <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@autos_electricos_con_fco\" style=\"color:#b4bdbc;text-decoration:underline;\">TikTok</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n                  <a href=\"mailto:vendedores@electrificarte.com\" style=\"color:#b4bdbc;text-decoration:underline;\">vendedores@electrificarte.com</a><br>\n                  Recibes este correo porque te suscribiste a la red de vendedores de electrificarte.com.\n                </td>\n              </tr></table>\n            </td></tr>\n          </table>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </td></tr>\n  </table>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "vd-mail-vendedor",
      "name": "Correo bienvenida (vendedor)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        180
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Resend (Authorization Bearer)"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 5,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "notes": "Asigná la credencial Resend. El html va en modo expresión (empieza con '='). Reintenta 5 veces cada 2 s: Resend limita a 10 envíos por segundo."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.resend.com/emails",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "keypair",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "from",
              "value": "Electrificarte <no-reply@electrificarte.com>"
            },
            {
              "name": "to",
              "value": "francisco@electrificarte.com"
            },
            {
              "name": "subject",
              "value": "Un vendedor pagó su suscripción"
            },
            {
              "name": "html",
              "value": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <title>Electrificarte</title>\n</head>\n<!--\n  VENDEDORES: aviso a Francisco de una suscripción pagada.\n  Lee del nodo Set \"Datos correo vendedor\": nombre, apellido, email, telefono, concesionario, marcas.\n\n  GENERADO por scripts/gen-emails.mjs (sistema de diseño v1). No editar a mano: cambiá el\n  generador y corré  node scripts/gen-emails.mjs && node scripts/gen-waitlist-reviews-workflows.mjs\n  Todo dato que escribe el usuario va escapado para HTML.\n-->\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f7f6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\">\n  <div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;\">Un vendedor pagó su suscripción. Hay que contactarlo para activarlo.</div>\n  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f2f7f6;\">\n    <tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:32px 12px;\">\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;\">\n\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:0 4px 20px;\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr>\n            <td><picture><source srcset=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-niebla.png\" media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"><img src=\"https://www.electrificarte.com/brand/email-wordmark-tinta.png\" alt=\"Electrificarte\" width=\"218\" height=\"16\" style=\"display:block;border:0;width:218px;height:16px;\"></picture></td>\n          </tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n\n        <tr><td style=\"background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dfe4e4;border-radius:12px;padding:36px 32px 32px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0f1716;\">Un vendedor pagó su suscripción</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Completó el registro y el pago. Contáctalo para verificar sus datos y activar su cuenta.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;border-top:1px solid #dfe4e4;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Vendedor</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Datos correo vendedor').item.json.nombre) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }} {{ String(($('Datos correo vendedor').item.json.apellido) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Punto de venta</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Datos correo vendedor').item.json.concesionario) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'Sin indicar' }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family